# YouTube is allowed in BOTH frame-src and script-src — owner directive,
# 2026-08-16 (evening): "loop player in home screen toggle like before with
# autoplay". Watch and the Home loop play channels in YouTube's OWN player.
#
# frame-src: the browser has to be allowed to frame the embed at all.
#
# script-src: www.youtube.com and s.ytimg.com serve the IFrame Player API.
# Earlier the same day this line deliberately excluded them, on the reasoning
# that a frame needs no script. That reasoning does not survive a LOOP: a plain
# frame cannot tell the page that a video ENDED or ERRORED, and those two
# events are the whole of a loop. Autoplay needs playVideo() on ready for the
# same reason — the URL parameter alone is unreliable inside a WebView.
#
# WHAT THE API DOES NOT WIDEN, which is the line actually worth guarding: it
# OPERATES YouTube's player, it does not hand ONIQ the video. No stream URL is
# resolved, stored or proxied anywhere in the app, and
# src/data/__tests__/watchDirectory.test.ts fails if one ever is.
#
# accounts.google.com stays in frame-src for OAuth.
#
# FOUR MORE PLAYERS IN frame-src, AND NOTHING MORE IN script-src — owner
# directive, 2026-09-03 (afternoon): "make them just like we have youtube in
# watch". player.vimeo.com, www.dailymotion.com, player.twitch.tv and
# archive.org are the platforms' own players, framed the way YouTube's is.
# None of their SDK scripts is loaded: ENDED reaches the page over the
# players' postMessage channels, so script-src did not move. The list is
# mirrored by EMBED_HOSTS in src/data/watchEmbeds.ts and held by
# src/data/__tests__/watchEmbeds.test.ts.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(self), microphone=(self), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.youtube.com https://s.ytimg.com; frame-src https://accounts.google.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://www.youtube.com https://player.vimeo.com https://www.dailymotion.com https://player.twitch.tv https://archive.org; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https: wss:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self' data: https:; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
